# MOST IMPORTANT OBJECTIVE

The goal is not to make Aegis appear correct.

The goal is to make Aegis **actually correct**.

If the system cannot prove a fact, it must say that it cannot prove it.

If it cannot identify an entity, it must say so.

If a source was not used, it must say so.

If only one source produced a value, it must not pretend multiple sources agreed.

If jurisdiction is unknown, it must not silently call it US.

If evidence is unavailable, it must remain unavailable.

**Truthful incompleteness is preferable to fabricated completeness.**